      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is something I’ve been wanting for years. When I personally look for home worlds the biggest turn off is when I’m spawned into a long hallway, even if the world itself is breathtaking it would be nice to spawn into the area I appreciate the most. With spawn points (wether home world spawn points or generalized) we as a community would easily be able to enjoy our favorite worlds without this specific road block, I believe it’d be a fantastic addition to VrChat.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
